        "original_id": "6911ab35-bf9f-55be-95d0-f1c5a5b577d3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Warwick, Matt Lucena, Ilie Năstase, Steve Siegel\n- Events: Cedar Grove Open\n- Roles: professional tennis players, doubles partners\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Warwick was born on 8 April 1952 and is an Australian former professional male tennis player.\n- Kim Warwick competed on the ATP Tour from 1970 to 1987 and reached the singles final of the Australian Open in 1980.\n- Matt Lucena was born on August 4, 1969 and is a former professional tennis player from the United States.\n- At the Cedar Grove Open, Ilie Năstase won the singles title.\n- At the Cedar Grove Open, Kim Warwick and Steve Siegel won the doubles title as partners.",
